    "competitors": ["<List of 1-2 competitors, if mentioned>"],
    "differentiators": ["<List of 2-3 skills that would make a candidate stand out>"],
    "identified_pain_points": ["<List of 2-3 problems the role is meant to solve>"],
    "company_mission_snippet": "<A short quote from the JD about the company mission>"
  }}
}}

**CRITICAL:** Return ONLY the valid JSON object. No preamble or explanation.

